    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Afar Gaarifaras",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana indhaha baan kor u taagay oo wax fiiriyey, oo waxaan arkay afar gaadhifaras oo ka soo baxay laba buurood dhexdood, buuruhuna waxay ahaayeen buuro naxaas ah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaadhifaraska kowaad waxaa waday fardo xamar ah, gaadhifaraska labaadna waxaa waday fardo madmadow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaadhifaraska saddexaadna waxaa waday fardo cadcad, gaadhifaraska afraadna waxaa waday fardo barbaro leh oo xoog badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaan jawaabay oo waxaan malaggii ila hadlay ku idhi, Sayidkaygiiyow, waa maxay kuwanu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasaa malaggii jawaabay oo wuxuu igu yidhi, Kuwanu waa samada afarteeda dabaylood, oo ka soo baxa meeshay Sayidka dhulka oo dhan ku hor taagnaayeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaadhifaraskii fardaha madmadow lahaa wuxuu tegayaa xagga dalka woqooyi, oo kuwa cadcaduna iyagay daba gelayaan, oo gaadhifaraskii fardaha barbaraha leh lahaana wuxuu tegayaa xagga dalka koonfureed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwii xoogga badnaana way soo bexeen, oo waxay doonayeen inay dhulka hore iyo dibba u dhex maraan, oo isna wuxuu ku yidhi, Taga oo dhulka hore iyo dibba u dhex mara. Oo iyana markaasay dhulkii hore iyo dibba u dhex mareen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu igu qayliyey, oo intuu ila hadlay ayuu igu yidhi, Bal eeg, kuwii xagga dalka woqooyi tegey ruuxaygii way ku qabowjiyeen dalka woqooyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Taaji Yashuuca",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana waxaa ii yimid Eraygii Rabbiga oo leh, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwii maxaabiista loo kaxaystay waxaad ka soo waddaa Xelday iyo Toobiyaah iyo Yedacyaah, oo isla maalintaasba kaalay, oo waxaad gashaa guriga Yoosiyaah ina Sefanyaah oo ay joogaan kuwii Baabuloon ka yimid. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waxaad iyaga ka qaaddaa lacag iyo dahab, oo waxaad ka samaysaa taaj, oo waxaad madaxa u saartaa Yashuuca ina Yehoosaadaaq oo ah wadaadka sare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaga la hadal, oo waxaad ku tidhaadaa, Rabbiga ciidammadu sidanuu u hadlaa oo leeyahay, Bal eega ninka magiciisu yahay Biqilka. Wuxuu ku kori doonaa meeshiisa, oo macbudka Rabbiga ayuu dhisi doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaga qudhiisa ayaa dhisi doona macbudka Rabbiga, oo isagu ammaantuu sidan doonaa, oo carshiga ayuu ku dul fadhiyi doonaa oo ku talin doonaa. Wuxuu ahaan doonaa wadaad carshigiisa ku dul fadhiya, oo labadoodaba waxaa u dhaxayn doona taladii nabaadiinada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo taajajka waxaa yeelan doona Xeelem iyo Toobiyaah iyo Yedacyaah iyo Xeen oo ah ina Sefanyaah, oo waxayna u ahaan doonaan xusuus macbudka Rabbiga ku jirta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kuwa meelaha fog jooga ayaa iman doona oo waxay ka shaqayn doonaan dhisidda macbudka Rabbiga, oo idinkuna waxaad ogaan doontaan in Rabbiga ciidammadu uu ii soo kiin diray. Tanu way ahaan doontaa haddaad ku dadaashaan inaad codka Rabbiga Ilaahiinna ah addeecdaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
